  "description": {
    "text": "The 2012 Pokémon World Championships, held from 10 to 12 August 2012 at the Hilton Waikoloa Village in Hawaii. Competitors got Tropical Beach in seven languages and staff a Staff copy; this was the first year with a Champion stamp above Finalist, so the trophy copies run from Top Thirty-Two up to Champion.\n\nThe top three of each age division received No. 1 to No. 3 Trainer trophy cards.",
